<div class="p-4" style="max-width:720px">
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
            <span><i class="bi bi-mouse2 me-2"></i>模拟键鼠</span>
            <button class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-sm" onclick="loadMockInputInfo()"><i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise"></i></button>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <p class="text-muted small">
                客户端通过全局低级钩子(WH_MOUSE_LL / WH_KEYBOARD_LL)检测 SendInput 等方式注入的模拟
                键盘鼠标事件(LLMHF_INJECTED / LLKHF_INJECTED 标志),用于发现模拟点击、宏与自动化挂机。
                <b>两个开关均关闭时,客户端不安装全局钩子,零开销。</b>
            </p>

            <div class="form-check form-switch mb-2">
                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="miReportSwitch" onchange="setMockInput()">
                <label class="form-check-label" for="miReportSwitch">
                    上报模拟键鼠事件
                    <span class="text-muted small">(作为会话事件上报到服务端,事件类型 mock_input)</span>
                </label>
            </div>
            <div class="form-check form-switch mb-3">
                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="miBlockSwitch" onchange="setMockInput()">
                <label class="form-check-label" for="miBlockSwitch">
                    拦截模拟键鼠事件
                    <span class="text-muted small">(吞掉事件,模拟操作不生效)</span>
                </label>
            </div>

            <div class="alert d-none" id="miMsg"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script src="/js/mock-input-dashboard.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
